# Step 3: Enriched Contacts UI/UX Mockup

*Based on user feedback, here is a proposal for how multiple contacts (from potentially different companies, titles, and with different emails) would look inside the expanded [OpportunityCard](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/src/components/signal/OpportunityCard.tsx#28-156) in Step 3.*

---

## 1. Tabular View (Collapsed Row)

Instead of cluttering the main table row with all contacts, we show the **Primary Lead** (highest priority, verified email) and a count of others.

| # | Article/Title | Involved Parties | Use Case | Primary POC | Primary Email | Location | Status | Actions |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
