## 2. Expanded Detail View ([OpportunityCard](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/src/components/signal/OpportunityCard.tsx#28-156))

When the user clicks the row to expand it, they see the usual sections (**Organisation Profile**, **Market Signal**, etc.). We add a new section: **Enriched Contacts & Involved Parties**.

We group contacts by **Company** so that different stakeholders (e.g., the buyer vs the partner/integrator) are visually separated. Each contact has a direct "Email" action.

